---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Conatus Real Estate"
  description="Ted Farry and Conatus Real Estate: deep SFR domain expertise, AI-native operations consulting, and responsible technology practices powered by Claude."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">About</p>
      <h1>Deep domain expertise.<br /><span class="accent">AI-native</span> execution.</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          Conatus Real Estate Inc. is an operations and technology consulting firm
          rooted in single-family residential real estate. We combine hands-on
          operational experience — 4,000+ SFR transactions and $1B+ in acquisitions
          capital — with AI-native development practices powered by Claude.
        </p>

        <h2>Ted Farry — Founder & Principal</h2>
        <p>
          Ted Farry founded Conatus Real Estate to bridge the gap between deep
          operational expertise and modern technology. His career spans both sides —
          building and operating real estate platforms at scale, then applying
          AI-native development to solve the same problems he lived as an operator.
        </p>

        <h3>Operational Background</h3>
        <p>
          Ted has built and operated platforms that executed 4,000+ SFR transactions
          and deployed over $1B in acquisitions capital. His experience covers the
          full SFR lifecycle: acquisitions, asset management, disposition, and
          compliance. On the asset management side, that includes SFR portfolio
          operations, HCV lease-ups, housing authority coordination, inspection
          management, and compliance workflows.
        </p>

        <h3>AI-Native Development</h3>
        <p>
          After years of building operational platforms the traditional way, Ted
          recognized that the deepest bottlenecks weren't solved by off-the-shelf
          SaaS. He adopted an AI-native development practice centered on Claude Code
          — using it daily to build custom tooling, orchestrate multi-agent
          development workflows, and ship production systems faster than traditional
          teams.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every platform Conatus builds leverages Claude through MCP integrations,
          autonomous agents, and AI-driven analysis pipelines. The development
          practice itself is AI-native: a custom orchestrator manages task
          decomposition, agent execution, quality gates, and iterative improvement
          across codebases.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every engagement starts with understanding the operational reality on the
          ground. Technology should serve operations, not the other way around. We
          build platforms that operators actually use — because they're built by
          someone who has been the operator.
        </p>

        <h2>Responsible AI Posture</h2>
        <p>
          We take a clear stance on how AI should be used in regulated industries:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Human review on all recommendations</strong> — AI provides analysis and surfaces insights, but every recommendation is reviewed by a human before action is taken.</li>
          <li><strong>AI as an analysis layer</strong> — Claude powers data processing, pattern recognition, and workflow automation. It does not make final decisions on transactions, compliance determinations, or client-facing advice.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparent to clients</strong> — When AI is part of a workflow, clients know. No black boxes.</li>
          <li><strong>Compliant with disclosure requirements</strong> — All AI-assisted processes are designed to meet California real estate disclosure requirements and applicable regulations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operator-built</strong> — We've run the operations we now build technology for. That means fewer assumptions and better products.</li>
          <li><strong>AI-native development</strong> — Every platform leverages Claude's intelligence through MCP integrations, autonomous agents, and AI-driven analysis pipelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Regulated industry focus</strong> — We understand compliance requirements, audit trails, and the operational constraints of regulated industries.</li>
          <li><strong>Production systems</strong> — Not prototypes or demos — purpose-built platforms running real operations at scale.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Domain Coverage</h2>
        <p>
          Our deepest expertise is in single-family residential real estate —
          acquisitions, asset management, HCV operations, and compliance. We're
          expanding across financial services, private lending, and asset management,
          applying the same approach: deep domain understanding combined with
          AI-powered platform development.
        </p>

        <h2>Location</h2>
        <p>
          5000 Birch Street, Suite 3000, Newport Beach, CA 92660<br />
          <a href="mailto:houses@conatusre.com">houses@conatusre.com</a> &middot;
          <a href="tel:+19492673990">(949) 267-3990</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
